{"id": "68870", "title": "仁心仁爱／医冠禽兽", "author": "夏末秋", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 30, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68870.htm", "intro": "一句话介绍\r\n\r\n两个优秀得让人嫉妒的天才医生的欢喜故事\r\n\r\n当大国手遇到海龟doctor\r\n\r\n他不满她不按常理出牌，她嘲讽他胆小怯懦，不像男人。\r\n\r\n不像男人？\r\n\r\n被质疑的宋医生眯起眼，慢悠悠地解皮带，脱裤子，并在某个嚣张女人的嗯嗯啊啊中为自己正了名。j\r\n\r\n事后，宋医生望着身下头发凌乱、面色潮红的女人问，“我是不是男人？”\r\n\r\n她勾住他的脖子，嫣然一笑，“那得看你的水平了。”-\r\n\r\n文案无能，大家直接戳第一章吧。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68870", "chapters": [{"title": "初遇", "file": "10550054.html", "available": false}, {"title": "纠纷", "file": "10550055.html", "available": false}, {"title": "再见", "file": "10550056.html", "available": false}, {"title": "共事", "file": "10550057.html", "available": false}, {"title": "又见", "file": "10550058.html", "available": false}, {"title": "克星", "file": "10550059.html", "available": false}, {"title": "内疚", "file": "10550060.html", "available": false}, {"title": "绝配", "file": "10550061.html", "available": false}, {"title": "受伤", "file": "10550062.html", "available": false}, {"title": "同居", "file": "10550063.html", "available": false}, {"title": "兄妹", "file": "10550064.html", "available": false}, {"title": "奸^夫", "file": "10550065.html", "available": false}, {"title": "见鬼", "file": "10550066.html", "available": false}, {"title": "道歉", "file": "10550067.html", "available": false}, {"title": "误会", "file": "10550068.html", "available": false}, {"title": "强吻", "file": "10550069.html", "available": false}, {"title": "真心", "file": "10550070.html", "available": false}, {"title": "感悟", "file": "10550071.html", "available": false}, {"title": "保护", "file": "10550072.html", "available": true}, {"title": "20-24", "file": "10550073.html", "available": true}, {"title": "25-28", "file": "10550074.html", "available": true}, {"title": "29-33", "file": "10550075.html", "available": true}, {"title": "34-38", "file": "10550076.html", "available": true}, {"title": "39-43", "file": "10550077.html", "available": true}, {"title